        <mxCell id="hdr" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Clip Factory Cloud on AWS. Repo &lt;code&gt;Lamo2real/clip-factory-legal&lt;/code&gt;, branch &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt;, one AWS account, one environment (&lt;code&gt;prod&lt;/code&gt;, prefix &lt;code&gt;cf-prod&lt;/code&gt;), region &lt;code&gt;eu-north-1&lt;/code&gt;, Terraform in &lt;code&gt;infra/&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Serverless only: 1 CloudFront distribution &amp;#183; 2 S3 buckets (web, media) &amp;#183; 1 Cognito user pool &amp;#183; 1 HTTP API &amp;#183; 4 Lambdas (Python 3.13, arm64) &amp;#183; 1 DynamoDB table (on-demand, PITR) &amp;#183; 1 SQS queue + DLQ &amp;#183; EventBridge Scheduler + 1 rule &amp;#183; 1 AgentCore runtime (Claude Fable 5.1 through Bedrock) &amp;#183; Amazon Transcribe &amp;#183; desktop app downloads (.dmg, .exe) and &lt;code&gt;/version.json&lt;/code&gt; in the web bucket &amp;#183; every push to &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; deploys through GitHub OIDC" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="54" width="2500" x="0" y="-70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
