        <mxCell id="ghdesk" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub Actions - &lt;code&gt;desktop&lt;/code&gt; job&lt;/b&gt; (in &lt;code&gt;deploy.yml&lt;/code&gt;, after the web)&lt;br&gt;&lt;code&gt;macos-latest&lt;/code&gt; runner: universal &lt;code&gt;Clip-Factory.dmg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;code&gt;windows-latest&lt;/code&gt; runner: NSIS &lt;code&gt;Clip-Factory-Setup.exe&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;unsigned for now; only when &lt;code&gt;desktop/**&lt;/code&gt; or the icon changed, or a file is missing" vertex="1">
